# pop'n music 9: the four event-phase codes, typed in test mode > EVENT OPTIONS > PASSWORD
# (games/popn9/unlocks.toml). From a save at phase 0, it leaves one at MAX phase:
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-phases.his
# Blue 6/4 turn the character wheel (0-9, A-Z; it starts on 0), red 5 enters. After the tenth
# character the game shows PHASE UPDATED and writes the save, then returns to EVENT OPTIONS
# on PASSWORD. Test-mode presses are 10 frames: 6 are missed in the submenus.
game popn9
